eLM4lvmdAqxZoM6W-eFIQuu4cK5yg&oe=6A68B391"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "209530720359829", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12482156_330591990784645_5608235378763890688_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kG8PRVtFzLcQ7kNvwEjgc06&_nc_oc=AdqngEK9K-ghnCMGUx8AU8s7erRBesLT2HkxznzUUsZWFls2AGlJxLGPW5HlwuR7QtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAgmFf8RfxkZPjsklLlM6jbVlsJq6ivJI_KWEDd-13YVw&oe=6A68BD62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_Trains_VR.png", "id": "1686115994800774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138782_1686116001467440_2909541305942016000_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FF02WA8KI7AQ7kNvwFduMjR&_nc_oc=Adqh_VgTmLJCzG4Kjwm08ZCcHLl5d_80leL6J6XhcXRxbScUiuUnnUlb4CfEsmt5QTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDt6d6NbHMAOIZaRf4nvcm0ora8sM-77uM3bV6LHb-ZEw&oe=6A68A9A1"}, "display_name": "Trains VR", "keywords": ["trains", "puzzle", "rail", "ride", "model"], "long_description": "For thousands of years people have dreamed about traveling. As a species we have achieved a lot - millions of railroad kilometers, endless highways and the fact that at any given moment there are half a million people flying around in the sky. We are even on the verge of space-tourism \ufffd. However, the most important journey is still beyond our reach... Or is it?\n\nTrains VR gives you the ultimate opportunity to find the best-fitting solution to railroad problems. Construct your route and ride on! Dive into a fantasy world of locomotives, stations and stars. Collect them all and become a master of the railroads.\n \nWith 40 levels you can challenge yourself with logical puzzles that have multiple solutions. Become a master builder and the fastest conductor.", "short_description": "Build your model railway and then transfer yourself into its world. Solve logistic challenges, gather cargo, u